{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2223","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Zhily and Colorful Strings"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"7 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Since Jily's first birthday, Zhily has given him a colored string as a gift each year, and each year's gift has been different from all previous ones. This year, Jily was amazed to discover that he has received every possible distinct gift!"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We call a colored string that meets the following conditions "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"valid"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" It consists of $$$m$$$ types of characters, with exactly $$$n_i$$$ characters of the $$$i$$$-th type; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Each character of the $$$i$$$-th type is colored with one of $$$c_i$$$ colors; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The string can be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"reduced"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" to an empty string by repeatedly deleting $$$d_i$$$ consecutive characters of the $$$i$$$-th type that share the same color. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Calculate the number of all "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"valid"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" colored strings, modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Two colored strings are considered different if they differ in at least one position (either in character type or in color)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$m$$$ ($$$1\\le m\\le 2\\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of types."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The $$$i$$$-th of the next $$$m$$$ lines contains $$$n_i, c_i, d_i$$$ ($$$1\\le c_i \\lt 998\\,244\\,353, 1\\le n_i, d_i \\le 10^8$$$) — the total count of characters of the $$$i$$$-th type, the number of colors for this type, and the required reduction length, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$\\left\\lceil\\frac{n_i}{d_i}\\right\\rceil$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output one integer in one line, representing the number of valid colored strings, modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n2\n2 1 1\n1 2 1\n2\n2 2 2\n2 1 2\n2\n6 2 3\n5 3 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n8\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the examples, let's number all the colors by $$$1, 2, \\ldots, \\sum_{j=1}^m c_j$$$. Where the colors $$$1+\\sum_{j=1}^{i-1} c_j,\\ldots,\\sum_{j=1}^i c_j$$$ are of the $$$i$$$-th type. Below, the color $$$1, 2, 3$$$ are colored red, blue, and green, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the first test case, the valid strings are:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[{\\color{red}1}, {\\color{red}1}, {\\color{blue}2}]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[{\\color{red}1}, {\\color{red}1}, {\\color{green}3}]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[{\\color{red}1}, {\\color{blue}2}, {\\color{red}1}]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[{\\color{red}1}, {\\color{green}3}, {\\color{red}1}]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[{\\color{blue}2}, {\\color{red}1}, {\\color{red}1}]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[{\\color{green}3}, {\\color{red}1}, {\\color{red}1}]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For any of these strings, we can first remove the only $$$2$$$ or $$$3$$$, and then remove the $$$2$$$ consecutive $$$1$$$s."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the second test case, the valid strings are:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[{\\color{red}1}, {\\color{red}1}, {\\color{green}3}, {\\color{green}3}]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[{\\color{red}1}, {\\color{green}3}, {\\color{green}3}, {\\color{red}1}]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[{\\color{blue}2}, {\\color{blue}2}, {\\color{green}3}, {\\color{green}3}]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[{\\color{blue}2}, {\\color{green}3}, {\\color{green}3}, {\\color{blue}2}]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[{\\color{green}3}, {\\color{red}1}, {\\color{red}1}, {\\color{green}3}]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[{\\color{green}3}, {\\color{blue}2}, {\\color{blue}2}, {\\color{green}3}]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[{\\color{green}3}, {\\color{green}3}, {\\color{red}1}, {\\color{red}1}]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[{\\color{green}3}, {\\color{green}3}, {\\color{blue}2}, {\\color{blue}2}]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the third test case, it can be easily seen that there are no valid strings."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"2223F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2223/problem/F"}